      "災數流行多疫癘",
      "一陽復後始安全"
    ],
    "source": "https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hant/%E9%97%9C%E8%81%96%E5%B8%9D%E5%90%9B%E9%9D%88%E7%B1%A4/92"
  },
  {
    "number": 93,
    "title": "第93簽 中平",
    "poem": [
      "春來雨水太連綿",
